{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo-developed action game themed on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Control Kujo Jotaro and hit Dio to the position of the sun above, then use the  &quot;The World&quot; to expose him to the sun for 3 seconds to defeat him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>Space</strong> to start the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/a97a81645c87e83fd66c3c03c5e086ff.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/a97a81645c87e83fd66c3c03c5e086ff.webm?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/a97a81645c87e83fd66c3c03c5e086ff.mp4?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect arrows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the corresponding button according to the direction indicated by the arrows on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W(up), S(down), A(left), D(right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/4fa150c77d5edca097cb453e9d91d50c.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/4fa150c77d5edca097cb453e9d91d50c.webm?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/4fa150c77d5edca097cb453e9d91d50c.mp4?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use arrows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the minus and plus signs next to the HP(<strong>Heart</strong>) and spiritual energy(<strong>Clock</strong>) to allocate the collected arrows\uff0cthen click the &quot;OK&quot; button above the arrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/e7dcac0f775e23ed633e4ddcc8cf59f2.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/e7dcac0f775e23ed633e4ddcc8cf59f2.webm?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/e7dcac0f775e23ed633e4ddcc8cf59f2.mp4?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Jotaro to attack Dio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move</strong>\uff1aW\u3001S\u3001A\u3001D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong>\uff1aU\u3001J\u3001K\u3001L</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World</strong>\uff1aSpace(Reduction of Spiritual energy)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/aed1cb5730da005afb982bb36fbafe6e.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/aed1cb5730da005afb982bb36fbafe6e.webm?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/aed1cb5730da005afb982bb36fbafe6e.mp4?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win\uff1aBurn all the heads of Dio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Dio`s head to the position of the sun above, then use the  &quot;The World&quot; to expose him to the sun for 3 seconds to burn him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/00ee869f55123ad5f5ae15f19776f676.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/00ee869f55123ad5f5ae15f19776f676.webm?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/00ee869f55123ad5f5ae15f19776f676.mp4?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack the withered tree and drop the item.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/23497eda0141d125dc102e7e437f214e.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/23497eda0141d125dc102e7e437f214e.webm?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/23497eda0141d125dc102e7e437f214e.mp4?t=1757061153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using &quot;the world&quot; allows you to attack the tractor and knives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143210/extras/8ffb1bc2336cebbea0c2c7060e7e2f93.poster.avif?t=1757061153\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"ht